e.","tagline":"Un vedovo in lutto si trasferisce nel paese dove un incontro casuale riaccende i ricordi del suo passato."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Out Stealing Horses","overview":"November 1999. 67-year-old Trond lives in new-found solitude and looks forward to spending New Year's Eve 2000 alone. As winter arrives he discovers he has a neighbor, a man Trond knew back in 1948, the summer he turned 15 and the summer Trond's father prepared him to carry the burden of his forthcoming betrayal and disappearance."},{"language":"no-NO","overview":"1999. Trond er 67. Han har flyttet til et øde sted i skogen. Når høsten nærmer seg vinter gleder han seg til Nyttårsaften 2000. Alene. Trond oppdager at han har en nabo. En mann han kjente sommeren 1948. Den sommeren faren forbereder han på det store sviket; han skal forsvinne ut av livet hans for godt. Den sommeren han for første gang kjente nærheten av en kvinne. Den samme kvinnen faren forsvant med."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMkWxrDS40vBsqHdC5KYcbjQSBQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2UGF2siYr7BNIAL9CmpYaVIEPFS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":512603,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"no-NO","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMkWxrDS40vBsqHdC5KYcbjQSBQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMkWxrDS40vBsqHdC5KYcbjQSBQ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMkWxrDS40vBsqHdC5KYcbjQSBQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMkWxrDS40vBsqHdC5KYcbjQSBQ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l8dqUEMK7ANC9NIZEelbCNV9UVq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l8d